sequenceDiagram
    actor Developer
    participant Cargo as cargo
    participant Tests as workspace tests
    participant Clippy as cargo clippy
    participant PreCommit as pre-commit hooks
    participant Git as remote branch

    Developer->>Cargo: cargo test --workspace
    Cargo->>Tests: run all 1393 tests
    Tests-->>Cargo: all pass
    Developer->>Clippy: cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings
    Clippy-->>Developer: lint clean
    Developer->>PreCommit: pre-commit run --all-files
    PreCommit-->>Developer: cargo-fmt + cargo-clippy hooks pass
    Developer->>Git: git push feat/code-atlas
    Git-->>Developer: branch updated
